  {
   "settings": {
    "event": [
     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So... Tronny?",
       "transl": "Ähm... Tronny?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DETERMINED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yes?",
       "transl": "Ja?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "TOWARD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Isn't this dungeon an amazing place?",
       "transl": "Ist der Dungeon hier nicht ein erstaunlicher Ort?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "TAUNTING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "It is! Quite amazing to see the bottom of the lake like this.",
       "transl": "Und ob! Ziemlich faszinierend, den Grund des Sees so zu sehen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I actually have to stop myself from staring at it for too long.",
       "transl": "Ich muss mich schon selbst davon abhalten, ihn zu lange anzustarren."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "EMBARRASSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "We're in a race after all.",
       "transl": "Wir sind schließlich mitten im Rennen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "THOUGHTFUL"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Is that all?",
       "transl": "Ist das alles?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "MOPING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Huh? What do you mean?",
       "transl": "Höh? Was meinst du?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "We're below a \\c[3]lake\\c[0]! And there's water everywhere!",
       "transl": "Wir sind unter einem \\c[3]See\\c[0]! Und hier ist überall Wasser!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "CURIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Aren't you supposed to complain about \\c[3]water pressure\\c[0] or something?",
       "transl": "Solltest du dich nicht über den \\c[3]Wasserdruck\\c[0] und so'n Zeug beschweren?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Oh...",
       "transl": "Oh..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Well... you see... It's fine here.",
       "transl": "Na ja... weißt du... Hier ist das in Ordnung."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "EMBARRASSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "This is not a natural cave after all.\\. It's a temple constructed by the Ancients.",
       "transl": "Das hier ist ja keine natürliche Höhle.\\. Es ist ein Tempel, der von den Ahnen gebaut wurde."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I'm sure they have the technology to create a separate circulation of water below a lake.",
       "transl": "Sie verfügten sicher über die Technologie, einen separaten Wasserkreislauf unter einem See zu schaffen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "EMBARRASSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So my suspension of disbelief isn't really compromised.",
       "transl": "Meine sonst geäußerten Zweifel sind damit also nicht kompromittiert."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Meeeh, this is boring!",
       "transl": "Ah nooon~, das ist doch langweilig!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "MOPING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Lea wait!",
       "transl": "Lea Warte!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SMUG"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Sure, Lea...",
       "transl": "Genau, Lea..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Wait, are you running ahead while we have these conversations?",
       "transl": "Moment, machst du einfach weiter, während wir uns hier unterhalten?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "CURIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "WHISTLING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Okay enough talking, race continues!!",
       "transl": "Ah non! Genug geredet, Rennen geht weiter!!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SHOCKED"
      }
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "settings": {
    "event": [
     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Bonjour, everyone! How is it going?",
       "transl": "Bonjour, ihr zwei! Wie läuft's?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Pretty well on my side!",
       "transl": "Bei mir ganz gut!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[киває]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I'm enjoying this entirely bug-free dungeon!",
       "transl": "Ich genieße diesen käferfreien Dungeon richtig!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SHRUG"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Well...\\. it is underwater-themed. Bugs really wouldn't fit in here.",
       "transl": "Na ja...\\. Es ist ein Unterwassertempel. Käfer würden hier nicht wirklich passen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "EMBARRASSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "That's right! Only lots of fish. Fish are ok.",
       "transl": "Stimmt! Dafür eine Menge Fische. Aber Fische sind in Ordnung."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Well...\\. and those blob thingies.",
       "transl": "Und diese Blob-Dinger."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "THOUGHTFUL"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "They're not too bad either. Pretty fun to punch into them!",
       "transl": "Die sind auch nicht schlecht. Macht richtig Spaß, da reinzuprügeln!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DISGUSTED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So...\\. all those enemies are \\c[3]Wave-themed\\c[0], right?",
       "transl": "Also...\\. All diese Gegner haben etwas mit dem \\c[3]Thema Welle\\c[0] zu tun, richtig?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Does that mean Wave is the element of \\c[3]fish and blob\\c[0]?",
       "transl": "Heißt das, dass Welle das Element von \\c[3]Fischen und Blobs\\c[0] ist?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I suppose it's related to water, but in an abstract way.",
       "transl": "Ich glaube, es ist mit Wasser verbunden, aber auf abstrakte Art."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "THOUGHTFUL"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "You got \"waves\" in water, but a lot of other things as well...",
       "transl": "Du hast \"Wellen\" im Wasser, aber auch in ganz vielen anderen Dingen..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "EMBARRASSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I for one am just glad it doesn't include bugs for once.",
       "transl": "Ich bin jedenfalls froh, dass ausnahmsweise mal keine Käfer dazugehören."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Lea wait!",
       "transl": "Lea Warte!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SMUG"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yes, yes. We get it, Lea.",
       "transl": "Ja, ja. Schon kapiert, Lea."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "EXHAUSTED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Let's race on!",
       "transl": "Weiter geht's!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DETERMINED"
      }
     }
    ]
   }
  }
 ]
}